1
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

2
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:21,380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

3
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:29,140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

5
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:33,220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

6
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:37,500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

7
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:40,780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

8
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:49,300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

9
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,380
♪Together, they are known♪

10
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:56,660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

11
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:31,900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

12
00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:34,980
[Episode 26]
[This story is purely fictional]

13
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:45,490
Eighth Master.

14
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,770
Could all those monsters drawn on these bamboo slips

15
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,380
be born from Yin Changsheng's magic?

16
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:49,770
Exactly.

17
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:50,740
They all came from

18
00:01:51,510 --> 00:01:52,180
the Mutation Pill.

19
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,020
Look at this.

20
00:01:53,590 --> 00:01:54,690
That's the pill Yin Changsheng made

21
00:01:54,870 --> 00:01:57,490
with radioactive meteorite copper.

22
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,490
Its intense effects cause

23
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,460
most creatures that consume it

24
00:02:00,710 --> 00:02:02,290
to die from radiation-induced mutations.

25
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,930
Only a few special creatures survived.

26
00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:07,020
Their bodies developed entirely new proteins.

27
00:02:07,430 --> 00:02:08,980
They underwent complete physical mutations

28
00:02:09,470 --> 00:02:10,980
and gained extraordinary abilities.

29
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:13,380
So not everything can mutate.

30
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,170
Only these six species can withstand it.

31
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:15,820
That's right.

32
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:18,340
There are only six in the world,

33
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:19,500
each corresponding to one of the Five Elements.

34
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:21,220
Metal.

35
00:02:21,590 --> 00:02:22,340
The pangolin.

36
00:02:23,190 --> 00:02:24,820
After taking the pill, it transforms into Peng Qiao.

37
00:02:25,430 --> 00:02:26,980
The scales that grow after its mutation

38
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,060
are a natural aphrodisiac.

39
00:02:28,430 --> 00:02:29,220
Anyone who touches them

40
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:31,220
develop intense sexual desire.

41
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,100
Wood.

42
00:02:32,590 --> 00:02:33,130
The mantis.

43
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:34,610
After taking the pill,

44
00:02:34,710 --> 00:02:35,570
it transforms into Peng Ju.

45
00:02:36,470 --> 00:02:38,100
Its feces possess unusual medical properties.

46
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:39,570
Anyone who touches them

47
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:40,820
become extremely agitated.

48
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:42,850
Their vision become distorted and dazzling.

49
00:02:43,430 --> 00:02:44,170
Water.

50
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,220
The pork tapeworm.

51
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,130
After taking the pill, it transforms into Peng Zhi.

52
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:48,890
Its mutated body

53
00:02:49,150 --> 00:02:51,080
produces a special hunger hormone

54
00:02:51,310 --> 00:02:52,980
that causes an endless hunger,

55
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,100
driving people insane.

56
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,170
Fire.

57
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:55,940
The wild snake.

58
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:58,060
After taking the pill, it transforms into a giant serpent.

59
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,610
It can secrete special pheromones that induce hallucinations.

60
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:01,820
Anyone who inhales them

61
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:03,220
immediately become trapped in an illusion.

62
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,450
They lose the ability to tell reality from illusion.

63
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,570
Earth is the most complicated.

64
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,060
It's divided into Yin and Yang.

65
00:03:08,590 --> 00:03:09,260
When humans take the pill,

66
00:03:09,430 --> 00:03:10,060
males and females undergo

67
00:03:10,150 --> 00:03:10,780
completely different mutations.

68
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,570
Men who take the Mutation Pill

69
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:14,450
first transform into multi-armed monsters,

70
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:17,060
eventually mutating completely into Zhainiangniang.

71
00:03:18,030 --> 00:03:19,380
The flakes of skin shed from their bodies

72
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:21,570
become the harmful Star-Moon Sand.

73
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:23,690
Women who take the Mutation Pill

74
00:03:23,870 --> 00:03:25,060
transform into long-haired women.

75
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:26,780
Their hair becomes

76
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:27,850
Zhurong Hair,

77
00:03:27,910 --> 00:03:29,130
which can neutralize

78
00:03:29,190 --> 00:03:30,010
the poison of Star-Moon Sand.

79
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,060
Then there's Lifeswapping Herb,

80
00:03:32,430 --> 00:03:34,170
a special variant of the morning glory.

81
00:03:34,630 --> 00:03:36,730
It looks almost identical to an ordinary morning glory.

82
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,500
After being mutated by the Mutation Pill,

83
00:03:38,750 --> 00:03:40,220
it has only one core effect.

84
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,570
That is slowing the metabolism.

85
00:03:43,630 --> 00:03:44,570
The metabolism

86
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:45,540
slows down indefinitely,

87
00:03:45,750 --> 00:03:47,290
preventing the body's old, dead skin

88
00:03:47,430 --> 00:03:48,660
from shedding normally.

89
00:03:49,470 --> 00:03:51,010
A person appears to age and deteriorate,

90
00:03:51,150 --> 00:03:52,170
with layers of flesh piling up,

91
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,260
yet they remain alive.

92
00:03:53,910 --> 00:03:55,850
That is the poison of Lifeswapping Herb.

93
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,170
The entire system of mutational toxins

94
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,570
is naturally balanced by the laws of Heaven.

95
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,820
The Star-Moon Sand produced by Zhainiangniang

96
00:04:02,030 --> 00:04:03,780
happens to neutralize the aging and metabolic-stagnation poison

97
00:04:03,870 --> 00:04:05,570
caused by Zhainiangniang.

98
00:04:06,030 --> 00:04:08,060
And the Zhurong hair produced by women who take the pill

99
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,570
happens to counteract

100
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:11,340
and neutralize the poison of Star-Moon Sand.

101
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,130
Everything suppresses something else,

102
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,890
forming a cycle of mutual generation and restraint.

103
00:04:15,870 --> 00:04:16,850
Now I finally understand.

104
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:19,460
All these strange phenomena and toxins

105
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:20,250
come from

106
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:22,370
the six mutated creatures,

107
00:04:22,390 --> 00:04:23,730
each one counterbalancing the others.

108
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,980
Exactly.

109
00:04:26,390 --> 00:04:27,850
What looks like the work of supernatural power

110
00:04:28,190 --> 00:04:29,660
is actually the result of mutations from the pills.

111
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:32,340
It's the creation and destruction resulting from protein restructuring.

112
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:34,660
Eighth Master,

113
00:04:35,390 --> 00:04:36,580
we should take Unit 401 with us

114
00:04:36,830 --> 00:04:37,930
and regroup with Master Zhang.

115
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,170
Master Zhang,

116
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:48,930
did you find Hatoyama?

117
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:49,780
Where is he?

118
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:50,780
His ultimate goal

119
00:04:51,510 --> 00:04:52,660
is to find the fruit chamber

120
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:53,490
and obtain the Star-Moon Sand.

121
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,140
Without me to guide him,

122
00:04:56,750 --> 00:04:57,850
he won't find it anytime soon.

123
00:04:58,630 --> 00:04:59,580
We still have a chance.

124
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,490
If we can't break the magic,

125
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,850
we can't kill Yoshiyuki Hatoyama.

126
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,250
Think again.

127
00:05:06,270 --> 00:05:07,020
How does he control

128
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:07,930
the Star-Moon Sand?

129
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:10,780
He'd never let me know

130
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:12,610
something like that.

131
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:15,780
The little bottle.

132
00:05:17,190 --> 00:05:18,370
He uses that little bottle

133
00:05:18,950 --> 00:05:19,930
every time he uses magic.

134
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,050
Destroying the bottle alone

135
00:05:22,070 --> 00:05:22,930
is useless.

136
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,170
Xiangu.

137
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:26,340
Xian...

138
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,410
What are you doing here?

139
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:33,730
Master Zhang,

140
00:05:34,070 --> 00:05:35,140
I discovered something important.

141
00:05:36,430 --> 00:05:37,410
The golden bottle

142
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,900
is one of Yin Changsheng's magical artifacts.

143
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:40,700
He uses it

144
00:05:41,390 --> 00:05:42,610
to disperse the Star-Moon Sand.

145
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,050
It can spread it over a great distance.

146
00:06:04,430 --> 00:06:05,050
Why did Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

147
00:06:05,070 --> 00:06:06,050
die here?

148
00:06:07,310 --> 00:06:07,810
Master Zhang,

149
00:06:08,750 --> 00:06:09,850
they all died by disembowelment.

150
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:11,170
The knife work was skilled.

151
00:06:12,510 --> 00:06:14,290
The Star-Moon Sand works

152
00:06:14,870 --> 00:06:16,050
because in the areas

153
00:06:16,870 --> 00:06:17,930
with a high concentration,

154
00:06:18,310 --> 00:06:19,370
the brain chooses to remember,

155
00:06:19,870 --> 00:06:20,850
while in areas with a low concentration,

156
00:06:21,190 --> 00:06:21,980
the brain forgets.

157
00:06:22,870 --> 00:06:23,780
Reality and illusion feed into each other,

158
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,250
and the magic becomes real.

159
00:06:36,270 --> 00:06:36,780
Laogou.

160
00:06:47,140 --> 00:06:48,420
[Core]

161
00:06:49,070 --> 00:06:49,660
What does it say?

162
00:06:50,270 --> 00:06:51,140
These are Japanese surveillance records

163
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,540
on Zhang Qishan.

164
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:59,020
So they'd already been

165
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,730
monitoring him

166
00:07:00,750 --> 00:07:01,850
before we went downstairs.

167
00:07:04,190 --> 00:07:04,610
Laogou,

168
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:05,580
look.

169
00:07:06,830 --> 00:07:08,050
These words mean

170
00:07:08,510 --> 00:07:09,410
the Ministry of War

171
00:07:09,750 --> 00:07:10,490
ordered Zhang Qishan

172
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:11,980
to wipe out the Mystic Nine.

173
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:24,980
Kill the Mystic Nine?

174
00:07:25,510 --> 00:07:27,660
[Equal Treatment of Citizens, Fair Administration]
The Mystic Nine conspired in rebellion,

175
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,140
aided bandits against the authorities,

176
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,410
and wreaked havoc in Changsha.

177
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:31,730
Their crimes are forgivable.

178
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:33,050
By military order,

179
00:07:33,630 --> 00:07:34,780
the six leaders

180
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,100
are to be executed on the spot.

181
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:37,100
Execute them.

182
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:44,540
Zhang Qishan is going to wipe out the Mystic Nine?

183
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:47,580
Impossible.

184
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:51,250
We can't let him do it.

185
00:07:52,390 --> 00:07:53,170
So

186
00:07:53,950 --> 00:07:55,290
the caster's suggestion

187
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:56,900
determines

188
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:57,490
which spell we see.

189
00:07:57,950 --> 00:07:58,610
That means

190
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,610
the little bottle

191
00:08:00,630 --> 00:08:01,610
is simply a dispersal device.

192
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,810
So destroying the bottle

193
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,980
can only stop Hatoyama

194
00:08:06,980 --> 00:08:08,170
temporarily.

195
00:08:08,750 --> 00:08:09,530
But most importantly,

196
00:08:10,270 --> 00:08:12,340
we have to destroy all the Star-Moon Sand.

197
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:12,990
Exactly.

198
00:08:13,310 --> 00:08:13,900
I have a way

199
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,220
to destroy the Star-Moon Sand.

200
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:20,490
Look at this.

201
00:08:21,390 --> 00:08:23,020
This is the space

202
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:23,900
we're in now.

203
00:08:26,310 --> 00:08:28,340
It resembles a giant morning glory.

204
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,660
Star-Moon Sand fills the entire area around us.

205
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,700
It makes people lose their memories,

206
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:35,060
which is why all this magic appears.

207
00:08:39,870 --> 00:08:41,100
So you've figured it out.

208
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:46,060
The key to breaking the effects of the Star-Moon Sand

209
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:47,250
is right here.

210
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,460
At the root of the entire flower.

211
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,610
There's something inside

212
00:08:52,270 --> 00:08:53,850
that can destroy all the Star-Moon Sand.

213
00:08:54,550 --> 00:08:55,940
Once we find this room,

214
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:56,980
everything

215
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:59,100
can finally end.

216
00:09:00,150 --> 00:09:01,420
Looks like she knows more

217
00:09:01,870 --> 00:09:03,010
than us.

218
00:09:05,150 --> 00:09:05,730
Impressive.

219
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,010
Master Zhang,

220
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,420
I can't explain everything

221
00:09:11,420 --> 00:09:12,180
right now,

222
00:09:12,390 --> 00:09:13,340
but please trust me.

223
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:16,890
As you suggested,

224
00:09:18,390 --> 00:09:19,220
we'll go here.

225
00:09:29,630 --> 00:09:30,490
Wu Laogou,

226
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:33,320
where is the fruit chamber?

227
00:09:33,750 --> 00:09:35,580
Inside my crotch.

228
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,100
Come and find out.

229
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,820
You're asking for it.

230
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:46,940
Punk!

231
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:54,770
Master Zhang will hold Hatoyama off.

232
00:09:55,270 --> 00:09:56,130
We'll go destroy the Star-Moon Sand.

233
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:57,420
Follow me.

234
00:10:05,790 --> 00:10:06,340
This way.

235
00:10:18,910 --> 00:10:19,460
We're here.

236
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:20,730
This is it.

237
00:10:26,780 --> 00:10:28,020
[Cause and effect intertwine in ways beyond comprehension]

238
00:10:28,390 --> 00:10:28,980
There's writing here.

239
00:10:29,980 --> 00:10:31,220
[The deluded mind seeks to see, but all is futile after countless ages]

240
00:10:31,790 --> 00:10:33,010
Cause and effect arise and perish together.

241
00:10:33,670 --> 00:10:34,490
[Arise]
They are intricately intertwined.

242
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:36,460
Anyone who tries to glimpse the workings of cause and effect

243
00:10:36,780 --> 00:10:37,670
[All is futile]

244
00:10:37,670 --> 00:10:38,650
[After countless ages]
will perish here.

245
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,300
There's danger ahead.

246
00:10:49,150 --> 00:10:49,730
Whatever.

247
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,130
They don't have much time left.

248
00:10:51,630 --> 00:10:52,130
Wait.

249
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:06,060
You know how to solve the mechanism now?

250
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:07,610
You taught me.

251
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:08,890
Remember?

252
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:12,700
I remember.

253
00:12:17,390 --> 00:12:18,460
Did all your memories come back?

254
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:21,980
You've changed.

255
00:12:23,870 --> 00:12:24,730
You're not the same as before.

256
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:28,180
You're much more decisive now.

257
00:12:31,630 --> 00:12:32,770
Because I'm not afraid anymore.

258
00:12:35,390 --> 00:12:36,340
Now that you're not afraid,

259
00:12:38,150 --> 00:12:38,700
and you

260
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:42,370
don't need me anymore.

261
00:12:51,550 --> 00:12:52,130
Let's go, Lao...

262
00:12:56,910 --> 00:12:57,460
Fifth Master.

263
00:13:12,550 --> 00:13:13,610
Don't rush.

264
00:13:14,390 --> 00:13:14,850
This is only

265
00:13:15,790 --> 00:13:17,340
the beginning.

266
00:13:35,270 --> 00:13:36,100
You punk!

267
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:37,420
That...

268
00:13:37,750 --> 00:13:38,850
That's a priceless treasure

269
00:13:38,870 --> 00:13:40,420
left behind by Yin Changsheng.

270
00:13:40,720 --> 00:13:42,180
You destroyed it just like that?

271
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:44,300
It's all just tricks to deceive the mind.

272
00:13:45,270 --> 00:13:45,770
But

273
00:13:46,390 --> 00:13:47,580
even if they're just tricks,

274
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:49,650
I won't let them

275
00:13:49,670 --> 00:13:50,890
fall into Japanese hands.

276
00:13:57,150 --> 00:13:58,610
So what if you've figured it all out?

277
00:13:59,270 --> 00:14:01,060
My experiment has succeeded.

278
00:14:01,550 --> 00:14:01,980
So today,

279
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:04,420
I'll use your deaths

280
00:14:04,550 --> 00:14:06,770
to prove my research was a success.

281
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:08,610
Attack!

282
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:16,730
Didn't expect this, did you?

283
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:18,060
Zhang Qishan,

284
00:14:18,670 --> 00:14:19,340
I've

285
00:14:19,670 --> 00:14:21,250
completely mastered

286
00:14:21,270 --> 00:14:22,730
Yin Changsheng's secret arts.

287
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:24,010
They

288
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:25,980
can not only fight,

289
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:28,420
but also produce Star-Moon Sand in large quantities.

290
00:14:28,790 --> 00:14:30,010
You turned humans into monsters.

291
00:14:30,750 --> 00:14:31,730
Is this how you treat

292
00:14:31,750 --> 00:14:32,940
your own soldiers?

293
00:14:33,030 --> 00:14:34,850
They're the pride of the Empire of Japan.

294
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:36,610
They're all warriors of war.

295
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:39,130
Master Zhang, we're here.

296
00:15:52,150 --> 00:15:53,220
Master Zhang, look.

297
00:15:55,150 --> 00:15:56,010
Master Zhang.

298
00:15:58,200 --> 00:15:58,890
Report, Master Zhang.

299
00:15:59,270 --> 00:16:00,650
All of Unit 401 has been recovered.

300
00:16:01,030 --> 00:16:01,890
Seventy-two men present,

301
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:02,820
twenty-five killed in action.

302
00:16:02,910 --> 00:16:03,530
Your orders, sir.

303
00:16:04,630 --> 00:16:05,530
Unit 401,

304
00:16:06,550 --> 00:16:07,370
after this battle,

305
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:08,940
we're going home.

306
00:16:10,910 --> 00:16:11,980
Three men to a team.

307
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:13,650
Take out their tendons and bones!

308
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:14,890
Yes, sir.

309
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:15,770
Men,

310
00:16:16,270 --> 00:16:18,100
we'll fight alongside Master Zhang!

311
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:21,890
Charge!

312
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:46,980
Zhang Qishan,

313
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:48,980
the cause was planted long ago,

314
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,850
and the fruit is destined to be mine.

315
00:16:50,870 --> 00:16:51,650
Stop fooling yourself.

316
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:52,890
You only desperately search for the fruit chamber

317
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:54,460
because your experiment failed.

318
00:16:54,600 --> 00:16:56,250
You think you've seen through me?

319
00:16:56,390 --> 00:16:57,490
Right now,

320
00:16:57,510 --> 00:16:59,250
you're already trapped in my illusion.

321
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:00,610
Fate is set.

322
00:17:00,670 --> 00:17:02,460
No one can defy the Heaven's will!

323
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:03,490
Defying fate

324
00:17:03,510 --> 00:17:04,530
is what I do best.

325
00:17:22,590 --> 00:17:24,730
The markings on Hatoyama's bottle.

326
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,620
Could it be what controls the magic?

327
00:17:28,510 --> 00:17:29,330
Or

328
00:17:31,070 --> 00:17:32,220
could the bottle in his hand

329
00:17:32,350 --> 00:17:34,010
produce different sounds

330
00:17:34,590 --> 00:17:35,660
or smells

331
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:36,860
to lure us in?

332
00:17:39,480 --> 00:17:41,900
Is he using Zhurong hair?

333
00:17:58,440 --> 00:17:58,940
Eighth Master,

334
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:00,380
take cover.

335
00:18:00,750 --> 00:18:01,330
Okay.

336
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:17,250
Eighth Master!

337
00:18:29,950 --> 00:18:31,320
Xiaoyu, get Tiezui out of here.

338
00:18:31,790 --> 00:18:32,290
Master Zhang,

339
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:33,550
I'm not leaving.

340
00:18:33,550 --> 00:18:34,180
Now!

341
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:49,220
Eighth Master, let's go.

342
00:18:58,070 --> 00:18:59,420
These are the roots of the morning glory.

343
00:19:00,830 --> 00:19:01,810
The source of the Otherworld Tower.

344
00:19:02,350 --> 00:19:03,810
They're also the key to ending all this.

345
00:19:05,310 --> 00:19:06,010
Could there be something here

346
00:19:06,830 --> 00:19:08,220
that can destroy the Star-Moon Sand?

347
00:19:24,400 --> 00:19:25,620
These aren't morning glory roots.

348
00:19:26,550 --> 00:19:27,220
They're hair.

349
00:20:45,830 --> 00:20:46,530
It's a hair crown.

350
00:20:57,480 --> 00:20:58,420
This man's clothes

351
00:20:59,590 --> 00:21:00,330
are exactly

352
00:21:00,350 --> 00:21:01,660
like those of the Otherworld Patriarch.

353
00:21:02,960 --> 00:21:04,290
Could it he the Otherworld Patriarch?

354
00:21:06,550 --> 00:21:07,460
Then who is this woman?

355
00:21:08,070 --> 00:21:09,250
His wife?

356
00:21:13,350 --> 00:21:14,330
The hair here

357
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:16,120
seems to have grown

358
00:21:16,120 --> 00:21:16,900
from this woman's corpse.

359
00:21:18,070 --> 00:21:19,250
Who exactly was this woman?

360
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:27,460
Xiangu,

361
00:21:28,030 --> 00:21:28,860
there's writing below.

362
00:21:40,590 --> 00:21:41,860
If you've made it this far,

363
00:21:43,110 --> 00:21:44,490
you must have endured many hardships,

364
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:47,900
all in search of immortality.

365
00:21:49,110 --> 00:21:51,140
I once sought the same thing.

366
00:21:52,110 --> 00:21:54,090
But the gates to immortality never opened,

367
00:21:55,920 --> 00:21:57,420
and I found myself in hell instead.

368
00:21:58,240 --> 00:21:59,860
I leave these words

369
00:22:00,790 --> 00:22:03,050
to reveal the truth to you.

370
00:22:04,310 --> 00:22:05,570
After joining the Otherworld Sect,

371
00:22:06,200 --> 00:22:07,700
I studied various arts

372
00:22:07,880 --> 00:22:09,180
with the Otherworld Patriarch,

373
00:22:09,830 --> 00:22:11,250
seeking to return to the primordial state.

374
00:22:12,830 --> 00:22:13,380
But unexpectedly,

375
00:22:14,200 --> 00:22:15,420
a ritual went out of control

376
00:22:15,640 --> 00:22:16,810
and unleashed countless monsters.

377
00:22:17,160 --> 00:22:19,010
The ancestral grounds of Changsha were plunged into disaster.

378
00:22:19,880 --> 00:22:20,620
The Otherworld Patriarch

379
00:22:20,680 --> 00:22:22,460
had no choice but to seal them away and bury them.

380
00:22:38,880 --> 00:22:39,860
The Otherworld Patriarch

381
00:22:40,480 --> 00:22:42,140
did not give up on his cultivation.

382
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:43,980
Instead, he returned to a hidden realm

383
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:45,010
deep in Xiangxi.

384
00:22:46,110 --> 00:22:48,660
This was where it all began.

385
00:22:49,790 --> 00:22:51,220
He had once received guidance from an immortal

386
00:22:51,440 --> 00:22:52,730
at the entrance to the secret realm.

387
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:54,770
Though he learned only the basics,

388
00:22:55,030 --> 00:22:56,290
he was already extraordinary.

389
00:22:57,510 --> 00:22:59,290
To advance his cultivation,

390
00:22:59,790 --> 00:23:01,090
the Otherworld Patriarch rebuilt the sect

391
00:23:01,720 --> 00:23:02,980
and led his remaining followers

392
00:23:03,110 --> 00:23:04,090
deep into the secret realm

393
00:23:04,590 --> 00:23:05,940
in search of more magical arts.

394
00:23:07,270 --> 00:23:08,010
Within the secret realm,

395
00:23:08,510 --> 00:23:09,490
we encountered

396
00:23:09,510 --> 00:23:11,090
many incredible arts.

397
00:23:15,550 --> 00:23:16,660
Sacrifice is inevitable

398
00:23:17,510 --> 00:23:18,940
on the path to enlightenment.

399
00:23:20,400 --> 00:23:22,050
Do not let their blood be shed in vain.

400
00:23:25,920 --> 00:23:27,530
But what I never expected was

401
00:23:28,480 --> 00:23:30,420
that these arts grew increasingly stranger and sinister.

402
00:23:31,030 --> 00:23:31,730
Unspeakable things

403
00:23:31,750 --> 00:23:33,010
lurked in the shadows.

404
00:23:34,160 --> 00:23:35,660
More and more people died.

405
00:23:36,350 --> 00:23:37,250
I kept wondering

406
00:23:37,440 --> 00:23:38,490
what kind of pace this really was.

407
00:23:41,110 --> 00:23:42,770
By the time we reached the deepest part of the secret realm,

408
00:23:43,400 --> 00:23:44,380
only the Otherworld Patriarch and I

409
00:23:44,400 --> 00:23:45,250
were still alive.

410
00:23:45,270 --> 00:23:46,250
Why?

411
00:23:46,790 --> 00:23:48,380
Why did it have to be this way?

412
00:23:49,030 --> 00:23:50,220
Just why?

413
00:23:52,160 --> 00:23:52,730
No.

414
00:23:53,070 --> 00:23:53,530
No.

415
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:54,770
No!

416
00:24:03,830 --> 00:24:04,570
No way.

417
00:24:05,510 --> 00:24:07,380
I have to recreate everything.

418
00:24:08,350 --> 00:24:10,140
I still possess the magic.

419
00:24:11,400 --> 00:24:13,490
With Yin Changsheng's pills,

420
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:16,010
I can turn illusion into reality

421
00:24:16,270 --> 00:24:17,420
and gather the followers once more.

422
00:24:19,310 --> 00:24:20,490
But it's a deception.

423
00:24:22,030 --> 00:24:22,940
There are no magical arts here

424
00:24:23,000 --> 00:24:23,980
at all.

425
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:30,010
What does it matter whether it's real or fake?

426
00:24:31,030 --> 00:24:32,420
Before you and I came here,

427
00:24:33,110 --> 00:24:34,940
didn't we believe it was real too?

428
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:36,530
No one in this world

429
00:24:37,000 --> 00:24:38,530
can see through it.

430
00:24:40,960 --> 00:24:42,810
But how can the dead come back to life?

431
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:45,900
Would you have even more people die?

432
00:24:47,270 --> 00:24:47,730
You!

433
00:24:48,310 --> 00:24:49,810
You're treating human lives as nothing.

434
00:24:50,920 --> 00:24:53,730
I use magic to give people new lives

435
00:24:54,590 --> 00:24:56,530
and deliver them from suffering.

436
00:24:57,550 --> 00:24:58,860
Is that not a good thing?

437
00:24:59,640 --> 00:25:02,220
How can there be salvation without sacrifice?

438
00:25:02,830 --> 00:25:04,420
Who can say

439
00:25:04,830 --> 00:25:06,290
this isn't the final test

440
00:25:06,790 --> 00:25:08,700
from Yin Changsheng?

441
00:25:10,350 --> 00:25:12,050
I thought it was all worth it.

442
00:25:12,680 --> 00:25:14,050
Yet all of Yin Changsheng's magical arts

443
00:25:14,440 --> 00:25:15,700
were illusions.

444
00:25:16,350 --> 00:25:17,570
It turns out all of them

445
00:25:17,960 --> 00:25:19,250
were simply caused by the pills

446
00:25:19,270 --> 00:25:19,860
Yin Changsheng created.

447
00:25:20,590 --> 00:25:22,730
This is the pill Yin Changsheng left behind.

448
00:25:22,960 --> 00:25:23,980
The Mutation Pill.

449
00:25:25,030 --> 00:25:26,730
Different creatures gain different effects

450
00:25:27,750 --> 00:25:29,250
after consuming it.

451
00:25:30,350 --> 00:25:31,250
Swallow the pill,

452
00:25:31,510 --> 00:25:32,770
and all kinds of monsters will emerge.

453
00:25:33,270 --> 00:25:34,490
It can also cloud people's minds

454
00:25:34,720 --> 00:25:35,810
and confuse their thoughts.

455
00:25:36,400 --> 00:25:37,180
In the end,

456
00:25:37,480 --> 00:25:39,140
it was all a deception.

457
00:25:39,440 --> 00:25:41,140
Your cultivation will then reach completion.

458
00:26:06,790 --> 00:26:07,900
The various creatures

459
00:26:07,960 --> 00:26:09,460
spawned by these pills,

460
00:26:10,200 --> 00:26:11,940
their flesh, blood, and shed skin,

461
00:26:12,070 --> 00:26:14,180
are all rare medicinal ingredients.

462
00:26:15,070 --> 00:26:16,460
Each of these ingredients

463
00:26:17,400 --> 00:26:18,810
has its own unique properties.

464
00:26:20,070 --> 00:26:22,490
They both complement and counteract one another.

465
00:26:26,350 --> 00:26:28,220
Once your hair is burned,

466
00:26:28,240 --> 00:26:29,530
the white smoke it produces

467
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:31,010
can neutralize

468
00:26:32,440 --> 00:26:33,940
the poison of Star-Moon Sand.

469
00:27:03,030 --> 00:27:04,050
See?

470
00:27:04,790 --> 00:27:06,770
You really are different.

471
00:27:07,750 --> 00:27:08,940
You knew all along

472
00:27:10,200 --> 00:27:11,810
there was no magic here, didn't you?

473
00:27:16,590 --> 00:27:17,180
Huazi,

474
00:27:19,790 --> 00:27:21,180
of all the many long-haired women

475
00:27:21,310 --> 00:27:23,010
I've sought,

476
00:27:25,200 --> 00:27:26,290
you're the only one

477
00:27:27,240 --> 00:27:29,140
who stayed with me to the very end.

478
00:27:30,960 --> 00:27:31,490
Perhaps

479
00:27:32,680 --> 00:27:34,140
this is fate.

480
00:27:37,350 --> 00:27:38,570
From the beginning to the end,

481
00:27:40,790 --> 00:27:41,860
I was nothing more

482
00:27:43,030 --> 00:27:44,380
than someone whose hair you could use.

483
00:28:29,920 --> 00:28:31,140
Believing in evil cults

484
00:28:31,880 --> 00:28:33,050
and trying to control life itself,

485
00:28:33,830 --> 00:28:34,810
or defying one's destiny,

486
00:28:35,440 --> 00:28:36,250
are all delusions.

487
00:28:38,680 --> 00:28:40,730
These pills and the creatures they spawned

488
00:28:41,270 --> 00:28:42,700
had claimed countless lives

489
00:28:43,110 --> 00:28:43,980
and brought endless harm.

490
00:28:44,640 --> 00:28:45,980
They must never leave this place.

491
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:49,530
I had taken all the pills.

492
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:51,660
Their medicinal power had been absorbed into my hair.

493
00:28:53,200 --> 00:28:55,010
Let me put an end to all this.

494
00:28:57,000 --> 00:28:57,460
This is the lifeline

495
00:28:58,070 --> 00:28:59,770
of the infinite Otherworld Towers.

496
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:01,900
Its energy can flow to every corner.

497
00:29:02,640 --> 00:29:03,700
If someone worthy comes here,

498
00:29:04,110 --> 00:29:05,660
please burn this hair for me.

499
00:29:06,880 --> 00:29:08,220
I hope those who come after us

500
00:29:09,200 --> 00:29:11,330
will remember that good deeds do not always bear good fruit.

501
00:29:11,960 --> 00:29:14,050
Sometimes, even bitter fruit can give rise to good shoots.

502
00:29:15,720 --> 00:29:17,330
There's no need to be obsessed with cause and effect.

503
00:29:35,830 --> 00:29:36,380
Since none of us

504
00:29:36,400 --> 00:29:37,660
can escape cause and effect,

505
00:29:39,880 --> 00:29:41,090
let's think about how to face it.

506
00:29:41,920 --> 00:29:43,290
Destroy the Otherworld Tower.

507
00:29:44,510 --> 00:29:45,330
Master Zhang is still waiting for us.

508
00:30:12,750 --> 00:30:13,620
Zhang Qishan,

509
00:30:14,270 --> 00:30:15,490
all I have to do

510
00:30:15,510 --> 00:30:16,900
is gently turn this bottle,

511
00:30:17,440 --> 00:30:19,730
and you'll forget everything.

512
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:23,090
I will make you fight for me.

513
00:30:39,550 --> 00:30:40,490
My memories may be taken away,

514
00:30:41,030 --> 00:30:42,140
but my blood won't forget who I am.

515
00:30:43,030 --> 00:30:44,460
The Chinese will show you

516
00:30:44,920 --> 00:30:46,420
what it means to bring about your own demise!

517
00:30:46,790 --> 00:30:49,290
You are the ones who bring about your own demise.

518
00:30:50,070 --> 00:30:51,460
Attack!

519
00:31:34,720 --> 00:31:36,250
Master Zhang!

520
00:31:53,310 --> 00:31:54,250
Master Zhang!

521
00:31:54,440 --> 00:31:55,290
Master Zhang!

522
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:57,250
Protect Master Zhang!

523
00:31:59,830 --> 00:32:00,420
Master Zhang!

524
00:32:01,640 --> 00:32:02,010
Master Zhang!

525
00:32:02,030 --> 00:32:03,530
Master Zhang!

526
00:32:05,000 --> 00:32:05,460
Master Zhang!

527
00:32:06,400 --> 00:32:07,490
- Master Zhang! - Master Zhang!

528
00:32:09,580 --> 00:32:10,660
Look.

529
00:32:11,270 --> 00:32:13,460
Your Master Zhang is about to die.

530
00:32:14,070 --> 00:32:16,050
Why are you still resisting?

531
00:32:16,310 --> 00:32:17,140
I promise

532
00:32:17,400 --> 00:32:18,490
that if you surrender,

533
00:32:18,590 --> 00:32:20,050
I'll let you go home.

534
00:32:20,270 --> 00:32:21,660
I'll use a magic

535
00:32:21,830 --> 00:32:24,620
to make you forget the humiliation and pain you're suffering now.

536
00:32:25,310 --> 00:32:28,010
You won't have to bear the guilt.

537
00:32:30,590 --> 00:32:31,700
Didn't you hear what Master Zhang said?

538
00:32:32,000 --> 00:32:33,180
Even if our memories are taken away,

539
00:32:33,440 --> 00:32:34,460
our blood won't forget who we are.

540
00:32:34,830 --> 00:32:35,420
Men,

541
00:32:35,830 --> 00:32:36,570
for the sake of our children,

542
00:32:36,960 --> 00:32:38,570
I can't bring myself to do something so disgraceful.

543
00:32:39,680 --> 00:32:40,180
Master Zhang,

544
00:32:41,400 --> 00:32:42,330
my name is Zhang Peiwu.

545
00:32:43,240 --> 00:32:44,250
Remember my name.

546
00:33:04,240 --> 00:33:06,140
Master Zhang, my name is Zhang Duo.

547
00:33:16,830 --> 00:33:18,140
My name is Zhang Licheng.

548
00:33:18,880 --> 00:33:20,940
Master Zhang, my name is Zhang He.

549
00:33:22,830 --> 00:33:25,380
Master Zhang, my name is Zhang Yuanbao.

550
00:33:26,400 --> 00:33:27,140
No!

551
00:34:15,400 --> 00:34:16,050
Zhang Song.

552
00:34:17,440 --> 00:34:18,570
Zhang Peiwu.

553
00:34:20,710 --> 00:34:21,610
Zhang Chengzhi.

554
00:34:21,670 --> 00:34:23,490
Zhang Ning. Zhang Li.

555
00:34:23,550 --> 00:34:25,900
Zhang Tinggu. Zhang He. Zhang Jingwen.

556
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:40,800
Master Zhang...

557
00:34:42,320 --> 00:34:42,860
Zhang Duo.

558
00:34:43,070 --> 00:34:43,650
Zhang Duo!

559
00:35:48,020 --> 00:35:50,860
♪Surrounded by chaos, I walk through karmic fire♪

560
00:35:51,060 --> 00:35:53,900
♪And swear this city shall never fall♪

561
00:35:54,140 --> 00:35:56,980
♪The code of honor, the realm's survival♪

562
00:35:57,260 --> 00:35:59,940
♪What must I do to live without shame?♪

563
00:35:59,940 --> 00:36:03,140
♪I fear no fate. My word carries the weight of mountains♪

564
00:36:03,340 --> 00:36:06,180
♪I guard this city, with no retreat, regret, or shame♪

565
00:36:06,500 --> 00:36:09,340
♪One cup of wine settles the storm. I rise like a mountain♪

566
00:36:09,500 --> 00:36:12,340
♪The Mystic Nine stand as one and share the same fate♪

567
00:36:12,460 --> 00:36:13,580
♪Hey♪

568
00:36:14,220 --> 00:36:17,260
♪Who dares mock my defiance?♪

569
00:36:17,440 --> 00:36:18,050
Impossible.

570
00:36:19,360 --> 00:36:20,570
He actually forced the poison of Star-Moon Sand

571
00:36:20,590 --> 00:36:22,090
out of his body.

572
00:36:23,360 --> 00:36:25,170
That's not something a human can do.

573
00:36:26,550 --> 00:36:27,490
Zhang Qishan,

574
00:36:28,360 --> 00:36:30,610
I know you are extraordinary.

575
00:36:31,440 --> 00:36:32,610
You're an excellent

576
00:36:32,630 --> 00:36:33,820
research subject.

577
00:36:34,400 --> 00:36:35,010
Still,

578
