579
00:36:39,660 --> 00:36:42,540
♪I'll crush the demons buried deep within♪

580
00:36:42,780 --> 00:36:45,740
♪And let the might of our land resound♪

581
00:36:46,260 --> 00:36:52,420
♪Through life and death, I'll stand with you♪

582
00:37:04,620 --> 00:37:06,020
♪Hey♪

583
00:37:06,700 --> 00:37:09,460
♪I refuse to believe Heaven's will cannot be defied♪

584
00:37:10,860 --> 00:37:18,220
♪I believe in neither gods, ghosts, nor reincarnation♪

585
00:37:18,220 --> 00:37:21,180
♪In this one life, I'll brave this thorny road♪

586
00:37:21,180 --> 00:37:24,140
♪With my blood aflame, I'll wrest justice back♪

587
00:37:24,300 --> 00:37:26,740
♪I'll fight my way out of this siege♪

588
00:37:27,260 --> 00:37:30,500
♪And tear the darkness apart♪

589
00:37:30,500 --> 00:37:33,420
♪Pour me a drink, however dark the road ahead♪

590
00:37:33,420 --> 00:37:36,420
♪I'll crush the demons buried deep within♪

591
00:37:36,660 --> 00:37:39,700
♪And let the might of our land resound♪

592
00:37:40,140 --> 00:37:46,300
♪Through life and death, I'll stand with you♪

593
00:37:58,180 --> 00:38:01,140
♪At the brink, I'll stand with you, with no way back♪

594
00:38:01,300 --> 00:38:04,140
♪I've never regretted defying fate...♪

595
00:38:04,190 --> 00:38:05,610
Zhang Qishan,

596
00:38:06,440 --> 00:38:06,940
you...

597
00:38:07,380 --> 00:38:10,460
♪Even if defeat carves my name in stone♪

598
00:38:10,460 --> 00:38:13,540
♪In this life, we'll break through once more...♪

599
00:38:14,760 --> 00:38:17,300
Attack...

600
00:38:20,140 --> 00:38:28,980
♪Life or death, I'll fight beside you♪

601
00:39:06,550 --> 00:39:06,980
Fifth Master.

602
00:39:07,360 --> 00:39:07,860
Madam Huo.

603
00:39:08,320 --> 00:39:08,980
