it's a military order.

616
00:39:35,110 --> 00:39:36,170
We're not to go back for him.

617
00:39:38,000 --> 00:39:39,650
I've never heard

618
00:39:39,760 --> 00:39:40,860
Master Zhang be this serious before.

619
00:39:41,670 --> 00:39:42,570
If you go in there,

620
00:39:43,440 --> 00:39:44,340
