623
00:40:02,280 --> 00:40:02,980
Master Zhang.

624
00:40:50,430 --> 00:40:51,020
Master Zhang!

625
00:41:15,310 --> 00:41:16,140
Master Zhang.

626
00:41:40,020 --> 00:41:44,180
♪The past fades like smoke♪

627
00:41:44,540 --> 00:41:47,260
♪A choice is made in silence♪

628
00:41:47,540 --> 00:41:50,340
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

629
00:41:50,740 --> 00:41:54,500
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

630
00:41:54,740 --> 00:41:58,180
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

631
00:41:58,460 --> 00:42:01,860
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

632
00:42:01,940 --> 00:42:09,220
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

633
00:42:09,660 --> 00:42:12,940
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

634
00:42:13,220 --> 00:42:16,460
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

635
00:42:16,620 --> 00:42:20,660
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

636
00:42:20,860 --> 00:42:24,220
♪Who believes in fate?♪

637
00:42:24,460 --> 00:42:27,820
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

638
00:42:28,060 --> 00:42:31,340
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

639
00:42:31,660 --> 00:42:35,340
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

640
00:42:35,540 --> 00:42:38,780
♪Take care♪

641
00:42:38,780 --> 00:42:41,340
♪We once raced♪

642
00:42:41,420 --> 00:42:43,340
♪For the dawn♪

643
00:42:43,500 --> 00:42:46,780
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

644
00:42:46,900 --> 00:42:50,180
♪In the web of fate♪

645
00:42:50,180 --> 00:42:53,380
♪No one can escape♪

646
00:42:54,380 --> 00:42:56,220
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

647
00:42:56,380 --> 00:42:57,940
♪We too were young once♪

648
00:42:58,020 --> 00:43:01,460
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

649
00:43:01,660 --> 00:43:03,980
♪Keep the ember lit♪

650
00:43:04,100 --> 00:43:08,620
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

651
